            "mimeType": "application/json",
            "size": 2117,
            "text": "{\"task_id\":\"4c1a75bf-a40c-465a-ab9f-7473d0cd7982\",\"metadata\":{\"prompt\":\"The cat from the reference image walks across a sunlit wooden floor.\",\"model_prompt\":\"subject_definitions:\\n<Subject 1> is the white cat with thick white fur, pointed ears, a pink nose, and heterochromia with one blue eye and one amber eye, featuring the posture and appearance shown in <Picture 1>.\\n\\nsummary:\\n[keyframe completion] The target video shows the white cat from <Picture 1> walking across a sunlit wooden floor.\\n\\nretention_analysis:\\n<Subject 1> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - the white cat's thick white fur, pointed ears, pink nose, and heterochromia with one blue eye and one amber eye are retained.\\n\\ndetailed_description:\\n[Shot 1] Live-action, cinematic, a medium-wide shot frames <Subject 1>, the white cat with thick white fur, pointed ears, a pink nose, and heterochromia featuring one blue eye and one amber eye as shown in <Picture 1>, positioned on a warm, polished wooden floor bathed in horizontal strips of warm sunlight. The camera tracks right with small amplitude at slow speed, following the cat as it lifts its left front paw and steps forward across the planks. Its tail sways gently behind it while amber and blue eyes remain focused ahead in the bright interior light.\\n\\noverall_soundscape:\\nSoft, muffled cat paw pads step across the polished wooden floorboards.\\n\\nnon_diegetic_music:\\nN/A\",\"prompt_expansion_elapsed_ms\":2057,\"prompt_enhancement_level\":null,\"high_motion\":null,\"optimization_level\":\"LOW\",\"optimization_level_adjusted_from\":null,\"model\":\"MiniMax-H3-Omni\",\"task_type\":\"R2V\",\"seed\":167111,\"fps\":null,\"height\":768,\"width\":1344,\"aspect_ratio\":\"16:9\",\"resolution_label\":null,\"duration_secs\":1.0,\"num_frames\":null,\"src_image_urls\":[\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/justintanner/apicity/d885599410f0a904c1d78ab74019e6a5fa97f00e/tests/fixtures/cat2.jpg\"],\"input_video_sec